      ":question/problem": "![](images/bb/bbfd8f27e48a2cab67475cb4a6175001b93348f885a882022ec79cb733771e6d.png)\n\nIn the diagram, $P$ lies on the segment $HR$. The given vectors are $\\overrightarrow{OH}=r$ and $\\overrightarrow{OR}=a$. The lengths satisfy $HP:PR=1:1$.\n\nExpress $\\overrightarrow{OP}$ in terms of $r$ and $a$. Fill in both coefficients, including their signs.\n\n$\\overrightarrow{OP}=$ {{field-1}} $r+$ {{field-2}} $a$",
